From 65c26a3cc3cdbadceabb76bedc3e47706ce3511c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Virgil Bucoci <virgil.bucoci@windriver.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 12:44:59 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Add StarlingX GPG key to debian package

To add StarlingX GPG key in binary format to grub source package it
needs to be added to debian/source/include-binaries.

Signed-off-by: Virgil Bucoci <virgil.bucoci@windriver.com>
---
 debian/source/include-binaries | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/debian/source/include-binaries b/debian/source/include-binaries
index 95a390b97..289f240f4 100644
--- a/debian/source/include-binaries
+++ b/debian/source/include-binaries
@@ -1 +1,2 @@
 debian/upstream-signing-key.pgp
+debian/starlingx/boot_pub_key
-- 
2.47.3

